      "props": {
        "doc": "Render {{ path | filter }} against a plain data context.\n\nThis is a path resolver, not an expression evaluator, and that is the whole\ndesign. {{ a.__class__ }} resolves to nothing because __class__ is not a key\nin a dictionary. Template injection is the cheapest remote code execution in\nevery automation platform that reached for Jinja here; the cost of not\nreaching for it is that playbooks cannot compute in a template, which they\nshould not be doing anyway.",
